  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>bI</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>cH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>xI</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>yMnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>zOH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>If the above equation is balanced with integer coefficients, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is ________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "08",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Reduction Half reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>Oxidation Half reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>Adding oxidation half and reduction half, net reaction is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>Ans</mi><mo> </mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
  }
